{"id":"35b5424a3b2d0629","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-gen-quantifier.md","title":"Generalized Quantifier","display":"df-gen-quantifier — Generalized Quantifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-gen-quantifier","aliases":["57-df-gen-quantifier"],"display":"df-gen-quantifier — Generalized Quantifier","depends_on":["[[57-df-abstract-logic]]","[[57-df-isomorphism]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-gen-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-gen-quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gen-quantifier — Generalized Quantifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"337462c47a6e0696\" href=\"?note=337462c47a6e0696\" title=\"57-df-abstract-logic\">57-df-abstract-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b82abcee4938fc49\" href=\"?note=b82abcee4938fc49\" title=\"57-df-isomorphism\">57-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、非空值域集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 为以全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构为定义域、以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为值域的候选类函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q^{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(Q^{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(Q(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>。类函数及类量词在背景类理论中使用，或在固定宇宙内作相对解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b82abcee4938fc49\" href=\"?note=b82abcee4938fc49\" title=\"57-df-isomorphism\">57-df-isomorphism</a>。本文件原“广义量词”只要求同构不变，不附加单调性、二值性或特定元数类型。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenQuant}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenQuant}\\)</span> 是下式定义的候选类函数类，其候选元素的签名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q:\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\to C\">\\(Q:\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\to C\\)</span>；同构不变性由定义式规定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq Q(\\mathfrak A)\\quad(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq Q(\\mathfrak A)\\quad(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}\\leftrightarrow Q:\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\to C\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\\to Q^{\\mathfrak A}=Q^{\\mathfrak B}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}\\leftrightarrow Q:\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\to C\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\\to Q^{\\mathfrak A}=Q^{\\mathfrak B}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"337462c47a6e0696","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"b82abcee4938fc49","anchor":"